OL,3,GNEWSAGovernment apologises over mass
OL,4,Agraves for stillborn babies
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe government has issued a "profound
OL,7,Fapology" to parents whose stillborn
OL,8,Fbabies were buried in mass graves
OL,9,Fwithout their knowledge.
OL,11,FMore than 1,000 babies were buried in
OL,12,Funmarked graves across Wirral in
OL,13,FMerseyside and a mass burial ground in
OL,14,FOldham also contained more than 270
OL,15,Fbabies.
OL,17,FGina Jacobs, from Wirral, did not learn
OL,18,Fwhere her son Robert had been buried
OL,19,Funtil 53 years after his stillbirth in
OL,20,F1969.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
